"write                                    turn                                   "
"enter        send · open focused block   esc          sheet → card → dropdown → "
"shift+enter  newline (ctrl+j ·           interrupt                              "
"alt+enter · \ enter)                     esc esc      rewind to an earlier turn "
"ctrl+a/e     line start/end (home ·      ctrl+c       stop · clear · twice exits"
"end)                                     ctrl+d       exit on an empty input    "
"alt+b/f      move one word               ctrl+t       show/hide tasks           "
"ctrl+w/u/k   delete word · to start ·    tab          complete → queue → next   "
"to end                                   row                                    "
"move                                     shift+tab    cycle permission mode     "
"up/down      history at first/last       1-9 · y/a/n  answer the open dialog    "
"input line                               ctrl+e       expand preview            "
"pgup/pgdn    scroll the transcript       ctrl+b       background running command"
"v · drag     select; arrows/drag         sessions                               "
"extend; y/ctrl+c/release copy            down         sessions (empty input)    "
"ctrl+o       expand result · again for   ctrl+g       sessions · ↑↓ to walk     "
"all                                      ?            toggle this panel         "
"click        a picture · open it                                                "
